Root cause:
The bug was caused by the `getopt()` function modifying the value of `args[1]`, which led to an incorrect assignment of the `dev` variable. This resulted in the `dev` variable holding an incorrect value when it was later used, causing failures in the `debugfs.ocfs2` functionality. The fix involved assigning `dev` before calling `getopt()` to ensure it retains the correct value.
